      },
      "rationale": "useIntentReviewSummary makes the selected task context summary read through the dashboard-owned conditional store, keyed locally by repo/master/leaf/facts. Mounted sequence checks prevent a superseded request from setting local state. A matching local answer is returned first; otherwise peek may return the retained same-address, same-facts answer, with loading only when neither is available. Rejected loads become unavailable rather than counts; this hook does not read the subject catalogue.",
      "role": "primary-authority"
    }
